<title>ITALY: Bank of Italy sets 15.0 trillion lire repo tender.</title>
<headline>Bank of Italy sets 15.0 trillion lire repo tender.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said it called a 15.0 trillion lire repurchase tender for today or Thursday for government securities to be resold on August 1.</p>
<p>At the previous comparable operation for 5.0 trillion lire on June 24, the minimum accepted rate stood at 6.90 percent and the average rate at 6.93 percent.</p>
